sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetChargingProfilesRequest (evseId = <Configured evseId>, chargingProfile.stackLevel = <Configured stackLevel>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message GetChargingProfilesRequest<br>- evseId <Configured evseId> AND<br>- chargingProfile.stackLevel <Configured stackLevel> AND<br>- chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be omitted AND<br>- chargingProfile.chargingLimitSource must be omitted AND<br>- chargingProfile.chargingProfileId must be omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: GetChargingProfilesResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: ReportChargingProfilesRequest (requestId = Generated Id)
    CSMS-->>CS: ReportChargingProfilesResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
